@startuml FRQ-CON-16.1-device-state
' Stanje uređaja — zauzeće i smjer.
' Gledište: ponašanje. Publika: implementator, tester.
' Prikaz, ne izvor istine (D-13) — izvor je FRQ-CON-16.1 §5–§6.
title FRQ-CON-16.1 — Device state: exclusive claim and half-duplex direction

[*] --> Registered : faktory (BR-01)

Registered --> Resolving : connect()
Resolving --> Failed_Unreachable : 0 pogodaka
Resolving --> Failed_Ambiguous   : >1 pogodak\n(nikad "uzmi prvi", BR-02)
Resolving --> Claiming           : točno 1 pogodak

Claiming --> Failed_Busy       : drži drugi proces\n(nabrajanje uspije, zauzimanje ne)
Claiming --> Failed_Permission : nema prava nad čvorom
Claiming --> Probing           : zauzeto

Probing --> Failed_Config : konfiguracija imenuje\nstupanj/ulaz koji uređaj nema (BR-11)
Probing --> Configured    : sposobnosti ispitane

Configured --> Connected : parametri primijenjeni\ni OČITANI natrag (BR-05)

state Connected {
  [*] --> Receiving : mode = Receive
  Receiving --> Idle : stop
  Idle --> Receiving : mode = Receive
  Idle --> Transmitting : mode = Transmit\n**samo uz ovlast (NFRQ-SEC-07)**
  Transmitting --> Idle : stop

  note right of Transmitting #FFCDD2
    Poluduplex: Receiving i Transmitting
    se **isključuju** (BR-12).
    Prijamnik nikad ne ulazi ovamo —
    directions ne sadrži Transmit.
  end note
}

Connected --> Interrupted : uređaj nestao\ns magistrale (BR-09)
Connected --> Released : disconnect()
Interrupted --> Released : disconnect()\n(idempotentno)
Released --> [*]

Failed_Unreachable --> [*]
Failed_Ambiguous --> [*]
Failed_Busy --> [*]
Failed_Permission --> [*]
Failed_Config --> [*]

note as N1
  Pet razreda kvara razlikuje se **tipom**,
  ne samo porukom (§8 k.6).
  "Prisutan" i "raspoloživ" su dva stanja:
  Resolving uspije dok Claiming padne.
end note

@enduml
